  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md says so) redistribute, software and models written by
  others under their own licenses. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists each one, where
  it comes from, its license, and how that was checked.

  The LICENSE file is the unmodified text of the GNU GPL version 3. The
